---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---

<section class="w-full py-20 section-gradient" id="por-que-elegirnos" aria-label="Por qué elegirnos">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="text-primary font-bold tracking-widest text-sm uppercase mb-2 block">Por Qué Elegirnos</span>
        <h2 class="text-foreground text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black leading-tight mb-6">
          Socios Estratégicos en su Operación
        </h2>
        <div class="h-1.5 w-20 bg-primary rounded-full mb-6"></div>
        <p class="text-muted text-lg">
          Garantizamos la continuidad operativa con soluciones integrales y soporte técnico en terreno.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 aspect-video rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-surface border border-border shadow-xl">
        <img
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          alt="Operación minera con maquinaria pesada"
          src={(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ASSETS_URL || '') + "/images/why-us.webp"}
          width="1920"
          height="1080"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-16">
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/5 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="inline-flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary">
          <Icon name="shield" size={28} />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-black leading-tight">Máxima Durabilidad</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">Neumáticos diseñados para condiciones extremas con mayor vida útil.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/5 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="inline-flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary">
          <Icon name="truck" size={28} />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-black leading-tight">Experiencia Minera</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">Más de 20 años resolviendo desafíos operativos en minería peruana.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-3 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 hover:border-primary/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/5 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="inline-flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary">
          <Icon name="trending" size={28} />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h3 class="text-foreground text-xl font-black leading-tight">Eficiencia Comprobada</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm">Optimice costos y reduzca tiempos de inactividad con productos certificados.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
